      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1752466401247,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "done\n\nCRON JOB 9:16 AM IST NODE.JS PROCESS, CACHE TO REDIS AND EXPIRY 9:15 AM IST\nBACKEND FIX THE GET OPTIONS DATA EXPIRY AND LIST OF INDICES\nCOMPLETE FE ADD STATERGY AND PLACE ORDER TRADEINFO CRUD INTERGRATION IN FE\nfe sticky\nCOMPLETE PYTHON LATEST INFO UPDATER TO THE REDIS STREAM\nSETUP PUBSUB AND REDIS STREAM\nmain node.js pubsub messger\ndb fix\nfrontend fix for api key crud operation\nbackend - api routes for crud(api key)\nlive price to core services (first fix) \nbackend-api routes for get,put,create,delete api credentials\nbackend - api -get position info\nbackend create,read,update position info (1 hr max)]\ncore service - getprice from wss \ncore-service -get data from redis stream\nredis stream consumers - core service \nget api key for live price fe service using db credentials\nget api key for live price for core service using db credentials\nnode.js live Position price for core service - few fixes\nauto update the values during edit fix issue\n\n\n\nplace order popup order placing without qty\nalso fix edit popup prevent it from placing orders\n\nfe sl and tp in points and premium value switcher or two boxes (pending for place order & edit order)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ljPsY72Z7-Ms06YJKVech",
      "originalText": "done\n\nCRON JOB 9:16 AM IST NODE.JS PROCESS, CACHE TO REDIS AND EXPIRY 9:15 AM IST\nBACKEND FIX THE GET OPTIONS DATA EXPIRY AND LIST OF INDICES\nCOMPLETE FE ADD STATERGY AND PLACE ORDER TRADEINFO CRUD INTERGRATION IN FE\nfe sticky\nCOMPLETE PYTHON LATEST INFO UPDATER TO THE REDIS STREAM\nSETUP PUBSUB AND REDIS STREAM\nmain node.js pubsub messger\ndb fix\nfrontend fix for api key crud operation\nbackend - api routes for crud(api key)\nlive price to core services (first fix) \nbackend-api routes for get,put,create,delete api credentials\nbackend - api -get position info\nbackend create,read,update position info (1 hr max)]\ncore service - getprice from wss \ncore-service -get data from redis stream\nredis stream consumers - core service \nget api key for live price fe service using db credentials\nget api key for live price for core service using db credentials\nnode.js live Position price for core service - few fixes\nauto update the values during edit fix issue\n\n\n\nplace order popup order placing without qty\nalso fix edit popup prevent it from placing orders\n\nfe sl and tp in points and premium value switcher or two boxes (pending for place order & edit order)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
