      "seed": 730776777,
      "version": 1484,
      "versionNonce": 948680608,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1750874245598,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "live price to core services\n\n\n\nget trade data from stream \n \nfrom the data get the required option live price and have them in\nmemory\n\n\ntrack the index price, if the price is higher than the point\nadjustment lower or upper limit update the required option live\nprice and have them in memory (only applies when the entry price\nis triggered)\n\nthe core service connects using socket.io and emit the all price\ndata to the core services on update\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "GkRUMULi1tp7nx_lTe_X2",
      "originalText": "live price to core services\n\n\n\nget trade data from stream \n \nfrom the data get the required option live price and have them in memory\n\n\ntrack the index price, if the price is higher than the point adjustment lower or upper limit update the required option live price and have them in memory (only applies when the entry price is triggered)\n\nthe core service connects using socket.io and emit the all price data to the core services on update\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
