      "text": "core service pending\n\ncalculate the required strikes using the trade info\ninitalize a global trade_details which contains the tradeinfo + \nrequired option\nwhen the price changes the lowest value (ce+pe) must be ther as\ndict item in the\nit must also have the nearest to zero strike price",
