      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "isssues but cannot be recreated\n\nsome times when the order is places there is an error in\nplacing order\nthe redis is not getting update\n\n\n\n\nwhile placing order and updating the order details to\nbackend there is an error and also, mainPrice is getting a\ndiffrent uuid and giving the lowest value so there is an issue\nwith the sl and tp service as it couldnt find the id int socket\narray \n\n\nwhen the sevices is started automatically using cron\nplace_order_service is not triggering the order \nand also core service is not working properly",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "543SwCtGZ-kyu_7MhLauv",
      "originalText": "isssues but cannot be recreated\n\nsome times when the order is places there is an error in placing order\nthe redis is not getting update\n\n\n\n\nwhile placing order and updating the order details to backend there is an error and also, mainPrice is getting a diffrent uuid and giving the lowest value so there is an issue with the sl and tp service as it couldnt find the id int socket array \n\n\nwhen the sevices is started automatically using cron\nplace_order_service is not triggering the order \nand also core service is not working properly",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
