      "text": "everything must be alive at 8.55 am and everything should close @ 3.40\n\noption Data - expires @ 8.30 am\ncron job @ 8.35 am\n\nmain socket & fe socket start @ 8.40 am stop @ 3.40 pm\n\ncore service should start @ 8.50 am, stop @ 3.40 pm\n",
